        "name": "Command: Dissonance",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Orianna commands her Ball to release a pulse of energy, dealing magic damage around it. This leaves a field behind that speeds up allies and slows enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Orianna commands her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span> to release an electric pulse, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to surrounding enemies.<br /><br />The pulse leaves behind an energy field for 3 seconds, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies by 20/25/30/35/40% and granting allies <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20/25/30/35/40% Move Speed</span>, decaying over 2 seconds.",
