        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Orianna commands her Ball to attach to an allied champion, Shielding them and dealing magic damage to any enemies it passes through on the way. Additionally, the Ball grants additional Armor and Magic Resist to the champion it is attached to.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive: </span>The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span> adds <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">6/12/18/24/30 Armor</span> and <span>6/12/18/24/30 Magic Resist</span> to the allied champion it is attached to.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active: </span>Orianna commands her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span> to attach to an allied champion, granting them <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(55/90/125/160/195 + ([[si:scaleap]]45% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 2.5 seconds. Enemies the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Ball</span> passes through take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/90/120/150/180 + ([[si:scaleap]]30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.",
